      "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Once the initial onslaught of krakens and minions subsides, it’s not too bad. Although, Tempest and Absolute Zero went down, and Haka ended with 1HP, and Fanatic with 2HP.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>MVP cards were Savage Mana and Wrathful Retribution.</p>",
