      "id": 206921,
      "name": "Melkhor",
      "username": "Melkhor",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-24T10:33:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Comfortable Mint here. Tempest went down early to a rapid deployment + Kraken onslaught, but that proved to be a blessing in disguise as he completely neutered the environment and fed Haka cards on his incapacitated side for the rest of the game. Everyone else finished in double digits and Voss went down from the one-two punch of Savage Mana (augmented by Haka of Battle) and Wrathful Retribution.</p><p>Honestly, Voss' Challenge rules are a complete non-factor if you're not playing him on advanced as there's absolutely no reason to ever flip him back once he's on the super-soldier side.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:36:29.697Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
