      "id": 206922,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-24T12:34:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Fairly easy mint, Voss's challenge rule barely comes into play the way I fight him.</p><p>Lost Tempest, but that was a good thing, because he kept the environment locked down. I mean, he's great for shutting down the ship, if you ignore the fact that he can't shut down the ongoing destruction. But I just kind of left it in play, sacrificing ongoings to attract the ire of the Kraken, and did the usual thing to blow up the warlord. :B It was nice having a base-game one-shot that didn't&nbsp;<em>feel</em> like \"just\" a base-game one-shot, you know?</p>",
