      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ac8455/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-24T23:10:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>mint, but I played SO stupid I didn't deserve it.&nbsp;</p><p>Played Cold snap on round 1, forgetting that the spaceship would nuke it before it went off. Then End of Days'd everything the next round just to get a clean slate.&nbsp;</p><p>Did throw a 26 point Wrathful retribution, followed the next round by a Rampage/Savage Mana combo for another 23 points. The left Voss at 1 hp. He took out Zero the next round, leaving Haka the last man standing.&nbsp;</p><p>Made Voss kill himself on Zero's incap turn.&nbsp;</p>",
