      "created_at": "2017-10-26T21:27:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I never played End of Days.</p><p>*SPOILERS*</p><p>I saved the Kraken to beat on one of Voss's minions on turn one so I could do more damage to the ship.</p><p>On the second turn, I let the Krakens (plural!) beat on the ship, because it was at 2 health.</p><p>On the third turn, Flash Flood took out the Krakens.</p><p>When Voss destroyed Forced Deployment, Tempest died, which lead to him keeping everyone safe from the rest of the environments.&nbsp; Then Haka rampaged everything and put them under Savage Mana.</p><p>The rest was cake (mostly).</p><p>*END SPOILERS*</p>",
